TITLE Viscosity transport problem
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7 charge
    Na 1
    Cl 1
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 1
    Cl 2
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.out
    -reset false
    -time true
    -totals Na Ca
USER_PUNCH
    -head step visco
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, VISCO
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 1
    -print_frequency 1
PRINT
    -reset false
END